        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>贵州茅台酒股份有限公司 2024 年年度报告</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]},\n  svg: {fontCache: 'global'}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #000;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 820px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 45px 30px 45px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .header {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 6px;\n    border-bottom: 1.5px solid #000;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  h3.num {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 26px 0 18px 0;\n  }\n  h3.num .idx {\n    display: inline-block;\n    min-width: 34px;\n  }\n  p {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    margin: 12px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  p.indent {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n    margin-top: 0;\n  }\n  p.tight {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .unit {\n    text-align: right;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin: 14px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    table-layout: fixed;\n  }\n  table td, table th {\n    border: 1px solid #000;\n    padding: 3px 4px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.t1 td.name {\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 6px;\n  }\n  .vert {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  table.small td, table.small th {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    padding: 2px 2px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  table.small td.nm {\n    font-size: 10px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n  }\n  .spacer { height: 26px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"header\">贵州茅台酒股份有限公司 2024 年年度报告</div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\"><span class=\"idx\">5、</span>其他原因的合并范围变动</h3>\n  <p class=\"tight\">说明其他原因导致的合并范围变动（如，新设子公司、清算子公司等）及其相关情况：</p>\n  <p class=\"tight\">□适用 &nbsp;√不适用</p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\">十、在其他主体中的权益</h3>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\"><span class=\"idx\">1、</span>在子公司中的权益</h3>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\">(1). 企业集团的构成</h3>\n\n  <p>√适用 &nbsp;□不适用</p>\n\n  <div class=\"unit\">单位：元 &nbsp;&nbsp;币种：人民币</div>\n\n  <table class=\"t1\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:26%\">\n      <col style=\"width:11%\">\n      <col style=\"width:17%\">\n      <col style=\"width:12%\">\n      <col style=\"width:5%\">\n      <col style=\"width:6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:11%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tr>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">子公司<br>名称</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">主要经<br>营地</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">注册资本</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">注册地</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"3\"><span class=\"vert\">业务性质</span></td>\n      <td colspan=\"2\">持股比例<br>（%）</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">取得<br>方式</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">直<br>接</td>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">间<br>接</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr style=\"display:none\"></tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州茅台酒进出口有限责任公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>8,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>贵州贵阳</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>70</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州茅台酒销售有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>10,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>贵州仁怀</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>95</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州茅台集团财务有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>2,500,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>贵州仁怀</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>51</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州茅台酱香酒营销有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>200,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>贵州仁怀</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>100</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">北京友谊使者商贸有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>30,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>北京</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>70</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州茅台酒巴黎贸易有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>80,728,429.80</td>\n      <td>法国巴黎</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>100</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"name\">贵州赖茅酒业有限公司</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>40,000,000.00</td>\n      <td>贵州贵阳</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>43</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td>投资设立</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p style=\"margin-top:26px\">持有半数或以下表决权但仍控制被投资单位、以及持有半数以上表决权但不控制被投资单位的依据：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">公司持有贵州赖茅酒业有限公司 43%的股权比例，但实质能够控制该公司，其原因在于公司在贵州赖茅酒业有限公司董事会成员超过半数。</p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\" style=\"margin-top:34px\">(2). 重要的非全资子公司</h3>\n\n  <p>√适用 &nbsp;□不适用</p>\n\n  <div class=\"unit\">单位：元 &nbsp;&nbsp;币种：人民币</div>\n\n  <table>\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:17%\">\n      <col style=\"width:14%\">\n      <col style=\"width:21%\">\n      <col style=\"width:21%\">\n      <col style=\"width:27%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tr>\n      <td>子公司名称</td>\n      <td>少数股东持股<br>比例</td>\n      <td>本期归属于少数股东的<br>损益</td>\n      <td>本期向少数股东宣<br>告分派的股利</td>\n      <td>期末少数股东权益余额</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>贵州茅台酒销售<br>有限公司</td>\n      <td>5%</td>\n      <td>2,426,087,299.55</td>\n      <td>1,976,050,000.00</td>\n      <td>3,178,624,026.55</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <p class=\"tight\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">子公司少数股东的持股比例不同于表决权比例的说明：</p>\n  <p class=\"tight\">□适用 &nbsp;√不适用</p>\n\n  <h3 class=\"num\" style=\"margin-top:34px\">(3). 重要非全资子公司的主要财务信息</h3>\n\n  <p>√适用 &nbsp;□不适用</p>\n\n  <div class=\"unit\">单位：万元 &nbsp;&nbsp;币种：人民币</div>\n\n  <table class=\"small\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:9%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n      <col style=\"width:7.6%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tr>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">子公司名称</td>\n      <td colspan=\"6\">期末余额</td>\n      <td colspan=\"6\">期初余额</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>流动资产</td>\n      <td>非流动资产</td>\n      <td>资产合计</td>\n      <td>流动负债</td>\n      <td>非流动负债</td>\n      <td>负债合计</td>\n      <td>流动资产</td>\n      <td>非流动资产</td>\n      <td>资产合计</td>\n      <td>流动负债</td>\n      <td>非流动负债</td>\n      <td>负债合计</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"nm\">贵州茅台酒销<br>售有限公司</td>\n      <td>8,619,829.59</td>\n      <td>91,993.62</td>\n      <td>8,711,823.21</td>\n      <td>2,333,411.51</td>\n      <td>21,163.65</td>\n      <td>2,354,575.16</td>\n      <td>8,695,706.31</td>\n      <td>78,493.84</td>\n      <td>8,774,200.15</td>\n      <td>3,303,086.46</td>\n      <td>13,940.23</td>\n      <td>3,317,026.69</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n  <div class=\"spacer\"></div>\n\n  <table class=\"small\" style=\"width:80%; margin-left:auto; margin-right:0;\">\n    <colgroup>\n      <col style=\"width:20%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n      <col style=\"width:10%\">\n    </colgroup>\n    <tr>\n      <td rowspan=\"2\">子公司名称</td>\n      <td colspan=\"4\">本期发生额</td>\n      <td colspan=\"4\">上期发生额</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>营业收入</td>\n      <td>净利润</td>\n   